+  bare `gh pr ready`. `test_the_template_text_is_pinned_to_its_version`
+  pins version 26.
+- **What no test covers.** The other rows of § 4 describe how an agent
+  follows the skill's prose, which no unit test can run. The next `spec`
+  run exercises them.
